# Package F "Sweet Revenge": Shani Kell has the key to the stash (sweet_revenge_stash) that holds the a braindance master.
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('sweet_revenge_bribed')
goto: Bribed

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: Please don't say my name out loud.
#
o_text: Stromberg sent me. Give me the master and he stops hunting you.
o_id: sweet_revenge_talk
o_cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(sweet_revenge)') && !HasItem('sweet_revenge_stash_key')
o_test: RollSkill('social', 'Hard')
o_succ: Yield
o_fail: Refuse
#
o_text: I could tell him you weren't here.
o_id: sweet_revenge_bribe
o_cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(sweet_revenge)') && !HasItem('bd_master') && !HasFlag('sweet_revenge_paid')
o_goto: Bribe
#
o_text: Why run?
o_id: sweet_revenge_lore
o_goto: Lore
#
o_text: Bye.
o_id: sweet_revenge_bye
o_goto: Bye

name: Lore
npc: He records everything. Every fear, every heartbeat. My last master was the night of the cleansing. I was at the south wall. He wants to sell that.
#
o_text: Back.
o_id: sweet_revenge_lore_back
o_goto: Default

name: Yield
npc: (She cries without a sound.) He'll never stop. But maybe he'll look away for a while. The key. Go.
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'sweet_revenge_stash_key', 1)
effect: EndConversation

name: Refuse
npc: You're his dog. Every one of you says that. Go away.
effect: EndConversation

name: Bribe
npc: (She presses money into your hand.) Three hundred. It's what I have. Tell him I went south, to the wall.
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'gold', 300)
effect: SetFlag('sweet_revenge_bribed')
effect: EndConversation

name: Bribed
npc: Thank you. Truly.
effect: EndConversation

name: Bye
npc: Don't tell anyone you saw me.
effect: EndConversation
